    feat(raylib-client): wire true GPU bone skinning for GpuSkinnedInstance

    Load skinning_instanced shaders on the GpuSkinned lane, cache Model+animations
    with fail-loud empty animCount, map AnimatorPackedState to clip/frame via
    RaylibSkinnedPlayback, and batch by (mesh, material, clip, frame, color) with
    UpdateModelAnimationBones + boneMatrices upload + DrawMeshInstanced.

    Co-authored-by: MightyBubble <MightyBubble@users.noreply.github.com>

